{"id":"14f0accd0b75a0b1","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-undecidability-reduction.md","title":"Undecidability Reduction","display":"thm-undecidability-reduction — Undecidability Reduction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-undecidability-reduction","aliases":["57-thm-undecidability-reduction"],"display":"thm-undecidability-reduction — Undecidability Reduction","depends_on":["[[57-df-syntactic-interpretation]]","[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-translation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-undecidability-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-undecidability-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-undecidability-reduction — Undecidability Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c06742bc27c04ba\" href=\"?note=5c06742bc27c04ba\" title=\"57-df-syntactic-interpretation\">57-df-syntactic-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fa79c8e3fa53370\" href=\"?note=5fa79c8e3fa53370\" title=\"57-df-translation\">57-df-translation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1,S_2\">\\(S_1,S_2\\)</span> 为有效一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_i}\">\\(T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_i}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g_i,S_i)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g_i,S_i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1,2\">\\(i=1,2\\)</span>）。两侧证明关系固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_H\">\\(\\vdash_H\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)\">\\(\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)\\)</span> 分别在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S_i,g_i,H)\">\\((S_i,g_i,H)\\)</span> 环境取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fa79c8e3fa53370\" href=\"?note=5fa79c8e3fa53370\" title=\"57-df-translation\">57-df-translation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 的函数、数集重载取既有定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynInterp}\">\\(\\mathrm{SynInterp}\\)</span> 以下式给出足以转移不可判定性的有效、保守翻译条件；若用四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 记其实现，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}\">\\(e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}\\)</span> 必须满足这些条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynInterp}(T_1,T_2)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e:(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1})\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\;\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(h)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\;(h(g_1(\\varphi))=g_2(e(\\varphi))\\land(T_1\\vdash_H\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T_2\\vdash_H e(\\varphi)))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SynInterp}(T_1,T_2)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e:(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1})\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\;\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(h)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\;(h(g_1(\\varphi))=g_2(e(\\varphi))\\land(T_1\\vdash_H\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T_2\\vdash_H e(\\varphi)))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynInterp}(T_1,T_2)\\land\\mathrm{Undec}(T_1)\\to\\mathrm{Undec}(T_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SynInterp}(T_1,T_2)\\land\\mathrm{Undec}(T_1)\\to\\mathrm{Undec}(T_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只有可证性保持而没有反射或没有有效性的解释不足以给出这个归约。原 SynInterp 没有正文定义，现明确列出此定理需要的编码归约条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-syntactic-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"5c06742bc27c04ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-syntactic-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"4107e891ce817208","anchor":"ref-2","