$）。两侧证明关系固定为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的 $\\vdash_H$；$\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)$ 分别在 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的 $(S_i,g_i,H)$ 环境取值。$\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)$ 取 [[57-df-translation]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的函数、数集重载取既有定义。$\\mathrm{SynInterp}$ 以下式给出足以转移不可判定性的有效、保守翻译条件；若用四元组 $\\mathcal I$ 记其实现，$e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}$ 必须满足这些条件。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"5fa79c8e3fa53370","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_1,S_2$ 为有效一阶语言，$T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_i}$、$\\mathrm{EffGN}(g_i,S_i)$（$i=1,2$）。两侧证明关系固定为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的 $\\vdash_H$；$\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)$ 分别在 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的 $(S_i,g_i,H)$ 环境取值。$\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)$ 取 [[57-df-translation]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的函数、数集重载取既有定义。$\\mathrm{SynInterp}$ 以下式给出足以转移不可判定性的有效、保守翻译条件；若用四元组 $\\mathcal I$ 记其实现，$e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}$ 必须满足这些条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_1,S_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g_i,S_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i=1,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(S_i,g_i,H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynInterp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynInterp}(T_1,T_2)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e:(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1})\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}\\;\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(h)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\;(h(g_1(\\varphi))=g_2(e(\\varphi))\\land(T_1\\vdash_H\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T_2\\vdash_H e(\\varphi)))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynInterp}(T_1,T_2)\\land\\mathrm{Undec}(T_1)\\to\\mathrm{Undec}(T_2).","display":true}],"bytes":1728,"backlinks